# Agent skills used for development (dev tooling). They are not part of the distributed product,
# which lives in skills/ (the founder-vn SKILL.md files, rewritten for Vietnam).
# - .agents/skills/<name>: the 27 mattpocock skills (MIT), pinned in skills-lock.json, committed so
#   an unattended Kiro Web lane finds `implement`, `tdd`, `pr`... in its sandbox checkout
#   (docs/agents/kiro-harness.md, FV-D6).
# - .kiro/skills/<name>: committed symlinks to the above.
# Excluded by name: the upstream founder-* skills (Jake Schincariol, MIT; rewritten into skills/)
# and the ID8Labs analyst skills (no license, must not be redistributed).
.kiro/skills/founder-*/
.kiro/skills/competitive-intelligence/
.kiro/skills/data-analyzer/
.kiro/skills/financial-analyst/
.kiro/skills/industry-expert/
.kiro/skills/literature-review/
.kiro/skills/market-research-analyst/
.kiro/skills/sentiment-analyzer/
.kiro/skills/seo-analyst/
.kiro/skills/survey-analyzer/
.kiro/skills/trend-spotter/
.kiro/skills/ui-builder/
.kiro/skills/user-research/

# Harness scratch: gate logs and segment ledger written in the sandbox (docs/agents/kiro-harness.md)
.harness/
